PASS: typed entity generation
usage: generate_operation_contracts.py [-h] [--check] schema_directory output

Generate deterministic typed wire adapters/metadata from explicit operation
schemas. This generator owns no document authority. IDs and field ordering
come from the schema, not traversal or registration order. No external Python
packages required.

positional arguments:
  schema_directory
  output

options:
  -h, --help        show this help message and exit
  --check
